
These are the files needed on the driver side.  The graphics driver's Control
function should dispatch to OGLDIB_Control instead of DIB_Control.
OGLDIB_Control dispatches internally to DIB_Control.

All vendors should link with ogl.obj.  Only the ogls3v.asm is changeable
by the vendor to fit their use.

* ogl.asm:	Assembly source for OGLDIB_Control.
		GIVE ONLY TO Microsoft ICD licensees!

* ogl.obj:	Assembled version of the above.  Give to people without
		Microsoft ICD licenses.

* ogls3v.asm:	Sample assembly code with constants needed by ogl.obj.
		Rename and alter to fit.
